              "writable": true
            },
            {
              "name": "effectivePkFields",
              "jsdoc": "实际生效的主键字段名列表（不含合成列 `_pk`）。\n- 多列自动合成时返回原始字段列表（`_syntheticPkFields`）\n- 否则返回 `[primaryKey]`\n@internal 供委托（`LocalMutationDelegate` 等）校验/遍历真实字段",
              "readable": true,
              "writable": false
            }
          ],
          "methods": [
            {
              "name": "ensurePkColumn",
              "jsdoc": "统一注册 `_pk` 计算列——无论单列还是多列主键。\n调用时机：\n- `dataTable` setter（列定义变更时）\n- `primaryKey` setter（显式覆盖时）\n幺等：字段列表不变时跳过重新注册。\n补计算（`_computedDelegate.apply(rows)`）由调用方负责。",
              "parameters": [],
              "type": {
                "type": "intrinsic",
                "name": "void"
